    <p class="meta">Master's thesis, self-published, July 2026, 299 pages</p>
    <p class="fliesstext">The study examines Ethereum against twelve criteria for fundamental infrastructure, in two states: the current one, as of March 2026, and the one that would result from full implementation of the roadmap. It was not submitted to any university. Written for corporate decision-makers, capital allocators, technical architects and policy-makers, not for the crypto scene.</p>
